00:01:28.429 --> 00:01:33.389
who is the Executive Director of
the Hosho Plattner Institute of Design at

00:01:33.389 --> 00:01:37.319
Stanford University,
known more simply as the D school.

00:01:37.319 --> 00:01:41.853
While leading this incredibly talented and
creative organization,

00:01:41.853 --> 00:01:47.327
Sarah found time to author an awesome book
